# A copy of a creature spell cast for sneak (CR 702.190b, 707.10f): Bot1 attacks with Ornithopter on turn 3 and sneaks Turncoat Kunoichi
# in for {2}{W}{B} (Black Lotus and Mox Jet), returning the Ornithopter. In response Choreographed Sparks (two Mountains) copies the
# creature spell: the copy becomes a hasty token that enters tapped and attacking Bot2 like the Kunoichi, so both are unblocked
# (the declare blockers step is over) and deal 3 each, Bot2 20 -> 14, and the token is sacrificed at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Turncoat Kunoichi
Choreographed Sparks
Ornithopter
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
